<title>POLAND: BFK SEPT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 2.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>BFK SEPT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 2.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.52 vs   1.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.39 vs   1.40</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.74 vs   3.26</p>
<p> Sales		   34.83 vs  28.73</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    20.78 vs  11.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	33.95 vs  16.07</p>
<p> Operating profit    41.01 vs  31.25</p>
<p> Sales		  270.37 vs 229.60</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Bydgoska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
